doc:452980b76a0b a prov:Entity , schema:text ;
	prov:generatedAtTime "2026-07-13T01:12:30.195412Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;
	schema:position 1 ;
	schema:identifier "452980b76a0b" .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Components are rarely operated to total failure, resulting in right-censored data." .
_:b4be8ba6e36d750423621a919f320efa rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Components are rarely operated to total failure, resulting in right-censored data." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 a schema:Text .
_:fe219bea6796a3c070f582ec030168ef rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 rdf:type schema:Text )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Right-censored data stifles the training of robust, generalisable models." .
_:ffd9e25269e898cdefa32863cdbdaf3b rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Right-censored data stifles the training of robust, generalisable models." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "While potentially accurate, these models are often challenging to develop and calibrate for complex, real-world systems exhibiting interactive failure modes and stochastic operational profiles." .
_:b0b7074351914cf9cf5a3c415bd03534 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "While potentially accurate, these models are often challenging to develop and calibrate for complex, real-world systems exhibiting interactive failure modes and stochastic operational profiles." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Predictive maintenance solutions minimise unplanned downtime and optimise asset utilisation." .
_:ebca9ad5054bd273a2d5fdcb009ded96 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Predictive maintenance solutions minimise unplanned downtime and optimise asset utilisation." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Developing accurate and interpretable RUL prediction methods is crucial for enabling condition-based maintenance strategies." .
_:ab31f40ad0827185ee51a999b1b29b9d rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Developing accurate and interpretable RUL prediction methods is crucial for enabling condition-based maintenance strategies." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "The need to generalise across diverse and unseen operational conditions leads to overfitting on limited failure modes present in small datasets." .
_:dfaf01b7e99ea31da4ac912c3f26f263 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "The need to generalise across diverse and unseen operational conditions leads to overfitting on limited failure modes present in small datasets." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "The transition towards smart manufacturing and Industry 4.0 has amplified the need for predictive maintenance solutions." .
_:f6d042d280ccfee01ab7dfb89b4c7585 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "The transition towards smart manufacturing and Industry 4.0 has amplified the need for predictive maintenance solutions." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Data augmentation techniques based on simple noise injection or statistical oversampling lack physical plausibility." .
_:c033e39f7856032f1595b8db45d98d9b rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Data augmentation techniques based on simple noise injection or statistical oversampling lack physical plausibility." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Incipient fault signatures may be diluted by data from healthy operation periods, leading to suboptimal feature learning and prediction latency." .
_:c88a91749b63688a6b89906e6ebc4842 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Incipient fault signatures may be diluted by data from healthy operation periods, leading to suboptimal feature learning and prediction latency." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Deep learning models learn intricate degradation patterns directly from historical sensor data." .
_:fb2e5b23905aa44dbec6e60a8f999971 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Deep learning models learn intricate degradation patterns directly from historical sensor data." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Uniform treatment of historical time steps is misaligned with the physics of degradation." .
_:b6e5fe40f854184ee6e2f57b24fc90f5 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Uniform treatment of historical time steps is misaligned with the physics of degradation." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "In the automotive supply chain, unexpected failures can lead to significant economic losses and safety risks." .
_:f7630038b1749487e8f5875e51143643 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "In the automotive supply chain, unexpected failures can lead to significant economic losses and safety risks." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Unrealistic trajectories generated by such augmentation do not improve generalisation to real failure dynamics." .
_:d8c0488e67a8d7d5e1fd640d2ef3494d rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Unrealistic trajectories generated by such augmentation do not improve generalisation to real failure dynamics." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Models such as recurrent neural networks, LSTMs, and CNNs typically assign uniform significance to all historical time steps." .
_:aec0d5b18d8206c8e457e016d68b4fa7 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Models such as recurrent neural networks, LSTMs, and CNNs typically assign uniform significance to all historical time steps." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "The proliferation of sensor technology and computational power has catalysed the dominance of data-driven techniques, particularly deep learning models." .
_:b6c0be431719afeb668932b87c6a5b54 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "The proliferation of sensor technology and computational power has catalysed the dominance of data-driven techniques, particularly deep learning models." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Prevailing deep learning models for RUL prediction are hampered by temporal indiscriminateness and data scarcity." .
_:ffe3a6e09fb2f073a6de6a571e44e9c0 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Prevailing deep learning models for RUL prediction are hampered by temporal indiscriminateness and data scarcity." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Deep learning models demonstrate remarkable success in various applications." .
_:d6f8f478e4a09d9e9426559745d968ca rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Deep learning models demonstrate remarkable success in various applications." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Deep learning models bypass the need for explicit physical laws." .
_:cc6f44464e251745af28d186918250b7 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Deep learning models bypass the need for explicit physical laws." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "These models include convolutional neural networks (CNNs) and long short-term memory (LSTM) networks." .
_:cb5b31f3ba674e1fa1e7dac3c1a208ba rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "These models include convolutional neural networks (CNNs) and long short-term memory (LSTM) networks." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Acquiring high-quality, complete run-to-failure datasets from safety-critical automotive components like engines, bearings, or batteries is operationally prohibitive and economically impractical." .
_:aafbe138cb60c5d40680725ab583eeab rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsfact4_33 schema:text "Acquiring high-quality, complete run-to-failure datasets from safety-critical automotive components like engines, bearings, or batteries is operationally prohibitive and economically impractical." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:452980b76a0b .
